      "text": "#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# Meet-in-the-middle on 2DES (educational block cipher with 16-bit keys).\n# E(C) = E_k2(E_k1(P)); build a table of E_k1(P) for all k1, then for each k2\n# compute D_k2(C) and look it up -> recover both keys in ~2^16 steps.\nP = 0x30313233\nC = 0x86fde3a0\nSBOX = [99, 124, 119, 123, 242, 107, 111, 197, 48, 1, 103, 43, 254, 215, 171, 118, 202, 130, 201, 125, 250, 89, 71, 240, 173, 212, 162, 175, 156, 164, 114, 192, 183, 253, 147, 38, 54, 63, 247, 204, 52, 165, 229, 241, 113, 216, 49, 21, 4, 199, 35, 195, 24, 150, 5, 154, 7, 18, 128, 226, 235, 39, 178, 117, 9, 131, 44, 26, 27, 110, 90, 160, 82, 59, 214, 179, 41, 227, 47, 132, 83, 209, 0, 237, 32, 252, 177, 91, 106, 203, 190, 57, 74, 76, 88, 207, 208, 239, 170, 251, 67, 77, 51, 133, 69, 249, 2, 127, 80, 60, 159, 168, 81, 163, 64, 143, 146, 157, 56, 245, 188, 182, 218, 33, 16, 255, 243, 210, 205, 12, 19, 236, 95, 151, 68, 23, 196, 167, 126, 61, 100, 93, 25, 115, 96, 129, 79, 220, 34, 42, 144, 136, 70, 238, 184, 20, 222, 94, 11, 219, 224, 50, 58, 10, 73, 6, 36, 92, 194, 211, 172, 98, 145, 149, 228, 121, 231, 200, 55, 109, 141, 213, 78, 169, 108, 86, 244, 234, 101, 122, 174, 8, 186, 120, 37, 46, 28, 166, 180, 198, 232, 221, 116, 31, 75, 189, 139, 138, 112, 62, 181, 102, 72, 3, 246, 14, 97, 53, 87, 185, 134, 193, 29, 158, 225, 248, 152, 17, 105, 217, 142, 148, 155, 30, 135, 233, 206, 85, 40, 223, 140, 161, 137, 13, 191, 230, 66, 104, 65, 153, 45, 15, 176, 84, 187, 22]\ndef F(r,k):\n    x=(r^k)&0xffff\n    return ((SBOX[x&0xff]<<8)|SBOX[(x>>8)&0xff])&0xffff\ndef enc(block,k):\n    L=(block>>16)&0xffff; R=block&0xffff\n    for i in range(4):\n        L,R=R,L^F(R,(k+i*0x1111)&0xffff)\n    return ((L<<16)|R)&0xffffffff\ndef dec(block,k):\n    L=(block>>16)&0xffff; R=block&0xffff\n    for i in reversed(range(4)):\n        L,R=R^F(L,(k+i*0x1111)&0xffff),L\n    return ((L<<16)|R)&0xffffffff\ntable={}\nfor kk in range(1<<16):\n    table.setdefault(enc(P,kk),kk)\nfor kk in range(1<<16):\n    if dec(C,kk) in table:\n        k1,k2=table[dec(C,kk)],kk\n        print(\"ciphertext        : 0x%08x\" % C)\n        print(\"meet in the middle: E_k1(P) == D_k2(C)\")\n        print(\"recovered k1=0x%04x  k2=0x%04x\" % (k1,k2))\n        print(\"flag: nto{2d3s_m1tm_%04x_%04x}\" % (k1,k2))\n        break\n"
